IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. VIEW-RULE.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
SELECT RATE-FILE ASSIGN TO 'RATELV'.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD RATE-FILE.
01 RATE-RECORD.
   05 RATE-VALUE PIC 9V9999.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 BASE-AMT PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 1000.
01 PREMIUM-AMT PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PROCESS.
OPEN INPUT RATE-FILE.
READ RATE-FILE
    AT END MOVE ZERO TO RATE-VALUE
END-READ.
*> Business calculation: View selected rate
COMPUTE PREMIUM-AMT = BASE-AMT * RATE-VALUE.
CLOSE RATE-FILE.
GOBACK.
